# Dance Dance Revolution 3rd Mix Plus (G*A22 VER. JAA), Konami 2000: the first boot, with the install cassette in the slot (MAME: -cassette install; HIRAKU:
# --cassette install). The 573 BIOS boots the CD, which installs itself, no inputs needed: the CD
# to the onboard flash, then to the PC Card in slot 2. Hashes the main RAM every frame and
# snapshots every 60 frames, to compare with MAME.
game ddr3mp

hash ram  0x80000000 0x80400000   # 4 MiB main RAM (KSEG0)

from 0 every 60 snap
at 24000 quit
